  "endpoint_assessment": {
    "hierarchy": "Node permits NARROWER_THAN relationships (R2462); R2470 applies inherited Declaration constraints to narrower Nodes; current Continuant R2589 and Occurrent R2590 establish branches. The 11 kind hierarchy claims are consistent with approved parent decisions.",
