    "workflow_run": "R2750’s exactly-one Workflow endpoint is consistent with current R2245@8, and archived R1510@18 supports exact-one definition link. R2417/Workflow endpoint preview adds explicit HAS_EXECUTION permission; still a Draft pending review/adoption.",
    "step_action_runs": "R2751 and R2752 use exact-one IS_EXECUTION_OF Step/Action; the only current relation signature R2245@8 is Workflow Run→Workflow. R2245@9 proposes widening, not Current authority. Current R1528@22 additionally requires leaf Step Run to have one Action through one Action Run and preserves nested Step Run parentage; the 11-kind preview does not itself provide all these relation endpoints. Keep the Step/Action bindings held until endpoint declarations and effective permissions are reviewed together.",
    "event_records": "R2755 references Event Record via IS_RECORDED_BY. Current R2246@8 and R2557@4 have older endpoints; relation/event DRAFTs propose the Event-target update, but those are not Current authority."
  },
